          "instagramCaption": "When tools become commodities, execution speed drops to zero. What separates eternal luxury from forgotten noise is taste.\n\nHere is the simple step-by-step breakdown:\n\n01 // When anyone can generate pixels, taste is the only moat.\n02 // The commodity deluge.\n03 // Pillar 1: Physical Materiality.\n04 // Pillar 2: Extreme Restraint.\n05 // Pillar 3: Cultural Narrative.\n06 // The Auteur Taste & Brand Moat Manifesto.\n07 // Want to master the art of auteur visual storytelling?\n\n---\n💾 SAVE this post so you have the formulas for your next project.\n✈️ SHARE with a friend or creator who needs this.\n👇 Drop \"TASTE\" in the comments and I will instantly DM you the complete free interactive playbook & prompt templates!\n\nproject\\ciel // BEYOND THE FRAME, INTO FEELING.",
